{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Plan a first meeting, try a self-screening intake, and prepare questions for consultation with a grounded clinician.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#f6efe6; /* warm parchment */
      --accent:#5a4b3c; /* deep umber */
      --muted:#7a6a5b;
      --teal:#2e6b68; /* grounding teal */
      --gold:#c89b4b;
      --card:#fff7f0;
      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --radius:12px;
      --max:980px;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;
      color-scheme: light;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{
      margin:0;
      background: var(--bg) url('assets/img/pattern.svg') repeat;
      display:flex;
      justify-content:center;
      padding:24px;
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
    }
    .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--max);}
    header{
      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:16px 8px;
    }
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{
      width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--teal),var(--accent));box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(46,107,104,0.12);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700;
    }
    nav{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;font-size:0.95rem}
    nav a:hover{background:var(--glass);color:var(--accent)}
    main{
      background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),rgba(255,255,255,0.95));border-radius:var(--radius);padding:22px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(86,70,60,0.06);
    }
    .hero{display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:flex-start}
    .hero-left{flex:1}
    h1{margin:4px 0 8px;font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--accent)}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}
    .contact-block{margin-top:14px;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(248,241,232,0.9),rgba(255,255,255,0.6));box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.6)}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:0.92rem}

    /* two column layout for tools */
    .tools{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:18px;margin-top:18px}
    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(86,70,60,0.04)}
    label{display:block;margin-top:10px;font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--muted)}
    input[type=text],select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(90,75,60,0.08);margin-top:6px;background:white}
    textarea{min-height:90px}
    .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--teal);color:white;border-radius:10px;border:0;cursor:pointer}
    .btn.secondary{background:transparent;color:var(--accent);border:1px solid rgba(90,75,60,0.08)}
    .output{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#fffdf9;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px dashed rgba(90,75,60,0.06);margin-top:10px;font-family:monospace;font-size:0.95rem}
    .small{font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--muted)}
    .wizard-step{display:none}
    .wizard-step.active{display:block}
    .steps{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px}
    .step-pill{padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(90,75,60,0.06);color:var(--muted);font-size:0.85rem}
    .footnote{font-size:0.86rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}
    footer{margin-top:18px;padding:12px;border-top:1px solid rgba(90,75,60,0.04);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
    .legal{font-size:0.84rem;color:var(--muted);max-width:70%}
    .crisis{color:#8b1d1d;font-weight:600}

    /* responsive */
    @media (max-width:880px){
      .tools{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .hero{flex-direction:column}
      nav{display:none}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo" aria-hidden>✦</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div class="small muted">Compassionate clinical support in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Primary">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
        <a href="specialties.html">Focus Areas</a>
        <a href="fees.html">Investments</a>
        <a href="faq.html">Questions</a>
        <a href="book.html">Begin</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-left">
          <h1>Connect and prepare for a first meeting</h1>
          <p class="lead">Use the tools here to sketch a focused plan and to generate helpful notes you can bring to the first consultation. These are practical aids—written to help you and your clinician start with clarity.</p>

          <div class="contact-block">
            <div class="muted">To schedule, call or email:</div>
            <div style="margin-top:8px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)">{{PHONE}} — {{EMAIL}}</div>
            <div style="margin-top:8px">
              <a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
              <a class="btn secondary" href="book.html">View openings & fees</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <aside style="width:320px">
          <div class="card">
            <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--teal)">Short intake snapshot</div>
            <div class="small muted" style="margin-top:6px">If you'd like a brief written note to share when you reach out, fill this and copy the summary.</div>
            <label for="snapName">Your name</label>
            <input id="snapName" type="text" placeholder="Optional">
            <label for="snapReason">What brings you in (one line)</label>
            <input id="snapReason" type="text" placeholder="A short phrase you can share">
            <button class="btn" id="snapBtn" style="margin-top:10px">Create snapshot</button>
            <div id="snapOut" class="output" aria-live="polite"></div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section class="tools">
        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px 0;color:var(--accent)">Session Planner</h3>
          <div class="small muted">A participatory tool to outline time, focus, and next steps. Build a simple plan, then copy a plaintext summary to share or save.</div>

          <label for="concern">Primary focus for coaching/therapy</label>
          <input id="concern" type="text" placeholder="e.g., career transition, overwhelm, relationship pattern">

          <label for="outcome">Preferred short-term outcome</label>
          <input id="outcome" type="text" placeholder="e.g., feel clearer about next step">

          <label for="program">Service shape</label>
          <select id="program">
            <option value="single">Focused Session — one meeting (single) </option>
            <option value="mini">Short Series — 3-session bridge</option>
            <option value="intensive">Concentrated Intensive — half/whole day option</option>
          </select>

          <label for="frequency">If recurring, suggested cadence</label>
          <select id="frequency">
            <option value="one">One time</option>
            <option value="weekly">Weekly</option>
            <option value="biweekly">Every other week</option>
            <option value="monthly">Monthly check-ins</option>
          </select>

          <label for="notes">Notes I want the clinician to see</label>
          <textarea id="notes" placeholder="Anything to share ahead of a meeting..."></textarea>

          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center">
            <button class="btn" id="planBuild">Build plan</button>
            <button class="btn secondary" id="planClear">Clear</button>
          </div>

          <div id="planOutput" class="output" aria-live="polite"></div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
            <button class="btn" id="copyPlan">Copy summary</button>
            <button class="btn secondary" id="downloadPlan">Download .txt</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="card">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px 0;color:var(--accent)">Self-screening intake wizard</h3>
          <div class="small muted">A guided, non-diagnostic intake to help you notice and name what matters. Use the generated question list to bring to your appointment.</div>

          <div class="steps" aria-hidden>
            <div class="step-pill">1</div>
            <div class="step-pill">2</div>
            <div class="step-pill">3</div>
          </div>

          <div id="wizard">
            <div class="wizard-step active" data-step="1">
              <label>What area of life feels most pressing? (pick one or two)</label>
              <select id="area">
                <option value="relationships">Relationships & family</option>
                <option value="work">Work & vocation</option>
                <option value="wellbeing">Wellbeing & daily life</option>
                <option value="identity">Identity & life transitions</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <div class="wizard-step" data-step="2">
              <label>How long have you noticed this concern?</label>
              <select id="duration">
                <option value="weeks">Several weeks</option>
                <option value="months">Several months</option>
                <option value="years">Years</option>
                <option value="recent">Recently changed</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <div class="wizard-step" data-step="3">
              <label>What would you most want to bring up in the first meeting?</label>
              <textarea id="firstTopics" placeholder="Short list of topics or questions..."></textarea>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
            <button class="btn" id="wizPrev">Back</button>
            <button class="btn" id="wizNext">Next</button>
          </div>

          <div id="wizOut" class="output" style="margin-top:12px"></div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
            <button class="btn" id="copyWiz">Copy questions</button>
            <button class="btn secondary" id="resetWiz">Reset</button>
          </div>

          <div class="footnote">
            These prompts are a way to prepare for a clinical conversation—non-diagnostic, private, and for planning only.
          </div>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <footer>
        <div class="legal">
          Sessions and notes are confidential within clinical limits. For details on privacy, scope of practice, and informed consent please ask at your first meeting. I do not provide emergency services here. If you are in immediate danger, or if there is risk of harm, contact local emergency services or a crisis line right away. For non-urgent concerns, reach me at {{EMAIL}} or call {{PHONE}}.
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:right">
          <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)">Licensed clinician</div>
          <div class="small muted">In {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • Private practice</div>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Snapshot quick note
    document.getElementById('snapBtn').addEventListener('click', function(){
      var name = document.getElementById('snapName').value.trim();
      var reason = document.getElementById('snapReason').value.trim();
      var out = '';
      if(name) out += 'Name: ' + name + '\n';
      if(reason) out += 'Brief reason: ' + reason + '\n';
      if(!out) out = 'No snapshot provided. Please add a short reason or name.';
      document.getElementById('snapOut').textContent = out;
    });

    // Session Planner
    function buildPlan(){
      var concern = document.getElementById('concern').value.trim();
      var outcome = document.getElementById('outcome').value.trim();
      var program = document.getElementById('program').value;
      var freq = document.getElementById('frequency').value;
      var notes = document.getElementById('notes').value.trim();

      var programLabel = {
        'single':'Focused session (single meeting)',
        'mini':'Short series (3 sessions)',
        'intensive':'Concentrated intensive (half or full day)'
      }[program] || program;

      var freqLabel = {
        'one':'One time',
        'weekly':'Weekly',
        'biweekly':'Every other week',
        'monthly':'Monthly'
      }[freq] || freq;

      var parts = [];
      parts.push('Session Plan — Prepared for initial consultation');
      parts.push('Primary focus: ' + (concern || '[not specified]'));
      parts.push('Short-term goal: ' + (outcome || '[not specified]'));
      parts.push('Service shape: ' + programLabel);
      parts.push('Suggested cadence: ' + freqLabel);
      if(notes) parts.push('Notes: ' + notes);
      parts.push('Contact: ' + '{{PHONE}}' + ' • ' + '{{EMAIL}}');
      parts.push('Prepared for: ' + '{{BUSINESS_NAME}}');

      return parts.join('\n');
    }

    document.getElementById('planBuild').addEventListener('click', function(){
      document.getElementById('planOutput').textContent = buildPlan();
    });
    document.getElementById('planClear').addEventListener('click', function(){
      ['concern','outcome','notes'].forEach(function(id){document.getElementById(id).value='';});
      document.getElementById('planOutput').textContent = '';
    });
    document.getElementById('copyPlan').addEventListener('click', function(){
      var txt = document.getElementById('planOutput').textContent;
      if(!txt){ alert('Build a plan first.'); return; }
      navigator.clipboard.writeText(txt).then(function(){
        alert('Plan copied to clipboard');
      });
    });
    document.getElementById('downloadPlan').addEventListener('click', function(){
      var txt = document.getElementById('planOutput').textContent || buildPlan();
      var blob = new Blob([txt],{type:'text/plain'});
      var url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
      var a = document.createElement('a');
      a.href = url; a.download = 'session-plan.txt';
      document.body.appendChild(a); a.click(); a.remove(); URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
    });

    // Wizard
    var currentStep = 1;
    function showStep(n){
      document.querySelectorAll('.wizard-step').forEach(function(el){
        el.classList.toggle('active', Number(el.getAttribute('data-step'))===n);
      });
    }
    document.getElementById('wizNext').addEventListener('click', function(){
      if(currentStep<3) currentStep++;
      showStep(currentStep);
      if(currentStep===3) document.getElementById('wizNext').textContent = 'Finish';
      if(currentStep>1) document.getElementById('wizPrev').disabled = false;
      if(currentStep===3) buildWizardOutput();
    });
    document.getElementById('wizPrev').addEventListener('click', function(){
      if(currentStep>1) currentStep--;
      showStep(currentStep);
      document.getElementById('wizNext').textContent = 'Next';
      if(currentStep===1) document.getElementById('wizPrev').disabled = true;
    });
    document.getElementById('wizPrev').disabled = true;

    function buildWizardOutput(){
      var area = document.getElementById('area').value;
      var duration = document.getElementById('duration').value;
      var topics = document.getElementById('firstTopics').value.trim();

      var questionList = [];
      questionList.push('Self-screening notes to bring to consultation:');
      questionList.push('- Area noticed: ' + area.replace(/-/g,' '));
      questionList.push('- Duration noted: ' + duration.replace(/-/g,' '));
      if(topics){
        questionList.push('- Topics I want to raise:');
        topics.split('\n').filter(Boolean).forEach(function(line){ questionList.push('  • ' + line.trim()); });
      } else {
        questionList.push('- Topics I want to raise: [open list]');
      }

      questionList.push('\nSuggested questions you might bring to a first meeting:');
      questionList.push('1) What would be a reasonable first step given these concerns?');
      questionList.push('2) What timeframe or shape of work do you suggest?');
      questionList.push('3) How do we handle notes, privacy, and limits of confidentiality?');

      var txt = questionList.join('\n');
      document.getElementById('wizOut').textContent = txt;
    }

    document.getElementById('copyWiz').addEventListener('click', function(){
      var txt = document.getElementById('wizOut').textContent;
      if(!txt){ alert('Complete the wizard to generate questions.'); return; }
      navigator.clipboard.writeText(txt).then(function(){ alert('Questions copied.'); });
    });
    document.getElementById('resetWiz').addEventListener('click', function(){
      currentStep=1; showStep(1); document.getElementById('area').selectedIndex=0; document.getElementById('duration').selectedIndex=0; document.getElementById('firstTopics').value=''; document.getElementById('wizOut').textContent=''; document.getElementById('wizPrev').disabled=true; document.getElementById('wizNext').textContent='Next';
    });

    // build initial wizard output on load
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function(){ showStep(1); });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Chunk 4 — contact page and notes for private_practice_therapist-MORE-2026-02-17T08-30-17-332Z-040

Files included:
- contact.html — Full contact/connect page with two interactive, local JS tools:
  - Session Planner: build a short plan (concern, outcome, service shape, cadence, notes). Produces a plaintext summary that can be copied or downloaded as .txt.
  - Self-screening intake wizard: a brief 3-step guided intake (non-diagnostic). Produces a short list of notes and suggested questions to bring to a consultation; copyable.
  - A small "snapshot" utility to prepare a one-line note for outreach.
  - Footer includes confidentiality, scope boundaries, and crisis guidance.

Notes & placeholders:
- The HTML uses placeholders that must be replaced by the templating system or build process:
  - {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
  - {{TAGLINE}} (unused on this page but available elsewhere)
  - {{PHONE}}
  - {{EMAIL}}
  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
  - {{CITY}}
  - {{STATE}}

Design & constraints:
- Layout uses an "earthy_warm" palette and a calm, modern voice; no external assets or CDNs are referenced.
- The page references assets/img/pattern.svg for a background motif; include a unique SVG there in the asset bundle (not provided in this chunk).
- All interactive behavior is local JavaScript — no external services.

Accessibility & clinical notes:
- Language is intentionally supportive and non-diagnostic. No medical claims or guarantees are made.
- Confidentiality, scope limits, and crisis instructions are included in the footer.
- Avoids manipulative scarcity; scheduling buttons link to placeholders and local book.html.

Developer hints:
- If you create assets/img/pattern.svg, ensure the pattern complements the earthy palette.
- The planner and wizard output plain text; easy to store or attach to a contact form.
- To integrate with a booking flow, wire {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} to the booking endpoint (book.html or external scheduling tool).

End of chunk 4."}
BUNDLE_END
